  "prefLabel": "Lab 211.03 Limitations on Public Participation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 211.03 Limitations on Public Participation. The labor commissioner, the labor commissioner’s designee, or board as applicable to preside over a hearing shall:\n\n(a) Refuse to recognize for speaking or revoke the recognition of any person who:\n\n(1) Speaks or acts in an abusive or disruptive manner;\n\n(2) Fails to keep comments relevant to the proposed rules that are the subject matter of the hearing; or\n\n(3) Restates more than once what they have already stated; and\n\n(b) Limit presentation on behalf of the same organization or entity to no more than 15 minutes, providing that all those representing such organization or entity may enter their name and addresses into the record as supporting the position of the organization or entity.\n\nSource. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26 (formerly Lab 210.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab200.html"
